Edited: 2026-11-05T05:22:47Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793860099977_1e6604ce]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793860099977_1e6604ce.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-05T06:29:10Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793860108537_57ffeac8]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793860108537_57ffeac8.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-05T06:29:10Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\nStart with the compact transcript; if a step has `truncated_fields`, read only that specific line in `transcript_full.jsonl`:\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl`\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript_full.jsonl`"}
